<title>POLAND: EXBUD SETS UP DEVELOPER SUBSIDIARY.</title>
<headline>EXBUD SETS UP DEVELOPER SUBSIDIARY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Exbud SA and the treasury have set a company, called Exbud Wschod SA, to provide developer services, the firm said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Exbud owns 50.8-percent of shares in the company, which has a capital of 13 million zlotys, and the treasury holds the remainder.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
